# Requests of lab 3.3 (REV-3), in the order of "Check it" in the lab booklet.
# Start first: your review-service, started fresh.
@reviewUrl = http://localhost:8083

### Rating of event 2, before any review
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/2/rating

### A review for event 1, 5 stars
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Alice", "stars": 5, "text": "Wonderful."}

### A review for event 1, 4 stars
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Ben", "stars": 4, "text": "Very good."}

### A review for event 1, 2 stars
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Cleo", "stars": 2, "text": "Too loud."}

### Reviews of event 1, two per page
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews?size=2

### Reviews of event 1
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews

### Rating of event 1
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/rating

### Broken JSON
POST {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{"author": "Dan", "stars":

### A wrong type in the URL
GET {{reviewUrl}}/api/events/abc/reviews
